          "x": 860,
          "y": 580,
          "id": "msl-discuss-9",
          "kind": "text",
          "size": 40,
          "step": 3,
          "text": "Yes. $24$ is in the $2$ list ($2\\times12$) and in the $3$ list ($3\\times8$).",
